    Grams per Dollar is a small, independent site about high-protein meal prep on a budget.
  </p>

  <h2>How prices are checked</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Prices come from US grocery chains' own websites and apps.</li>
    <li>They are shown as ranges, because prices differ by state and store.</li>
    <li>Every page shows the month its prices were last checked.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What this site is not</h2>
  <p>
    This site shares recipes, shopping lists and costs. It does not give medical, weight-loss
    or supplement advice. If you have a health condition, talk to a doctor or registered dietitian.
  </p>
